# Windows launchers end their lines with CRLF in every checkout, ZIP and release: cmd.exe misreads
# blocks and labels of an LF-only .bat (the portable 0.0.2 shipped Start_GIMaP.bat with LF only).
# The folder rules below come later and win for their own files.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# The proposal network of Predict parameters is checked against the SHA-256 of its record before it runs: binary.
src/gimap/features/fitting/domain/posterior/data/*.npz binary
# The bundled analysis package of the Sputter page (utils/sputter_client) is checked file by file against its
# MANIFEST.json (sha256 of the bytes); its launcher run.cmd ends its lines with CRLF and the rest with LF:
# no line-ending conversion in this folder.
utils/sputter_client/** -text
# The Slurm scripts of the 1D proposal network run on Linux: LF in every checkout.
tools/ml1d/maxwell/** text eol=lf
